WEBVTT

00:15:57.415 --> 00:16:01.276
Me pyesni çfare nuk kam bere.

00:16:01.276 --> 00:16:06.533
Une nuk i preva flatrat e saj, vetem kaq.

00:16:06.533 --> 00:16:09.415
Faleminderit shume.

00:16:09.415 --> 00:16:14.911
(Duartrokitje)

00:16:14.911 --> 00:16:18.911
Faleminderit. Faleminderit shume. Faleminderit. (Duartrokitje)